    "directions": [
      "Warm up your pre-cooked couscous in a pan and with coconut milk water , garlic, thyme, all-purpose, salt and pepper. Mix and steam through for 5 minutes.",
      "Season your salmon with salt, pepper, garlic, paprika, all-purpose, and a splash of browning and massage in.",
      "Pan-sear both sides in olive oil until golden, then remove and set aside.",
      "In the same pan, sauté onions, garlic,  scotch bonnet and your bell peppers til soft.",
      "Add vegetable stock, bring it to a simmer, then gently place your salmon back in and cook for 10 minutes.",
      "Let it steam down in that beautiful  brown stew sauce."
    ],
